# Battle against Cosmoem (the protostar, motionless in its shell): a held C-minor chord and a throbbing bass, then
# a slow vibraphone line that climbs an arpeggio and turns back, humming with gathered power. Original composition
# for this game.
# Arranged again for the modern sound (plan 31 · MU7) on the instruments of Alola: a steel drum doubling the tune, an ukulele chopping on the bass's eighths, congas and bongos.
title Battle! Cosmoem
tempo 132
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.09
reverb 0.38
sound modern
room hall 1.6

track lead steeldrum lowhp=sawlead vol=1.0 pan=0 rev=0.4
  o4 g4 o5 c4 e-4 g4 | o5 b2 o6 d2 |
  L o5 c4 g4 o6 c4 e-4 | o6 c2 o5 g2 | o5 a-4 o6 c4 e-4 f4 | o6 e-2 c2 |
  o5 f4 a-4 o6 c4 f4 | o6 e-2 c2 | o5 b4 o6 d4 f4 d4 | o5 b2 g2 |
  o5 g4 o6 c4 e-4 g4 | o6 g2 f4 e-4 | o6 c4 e-4 a-4 f8 e-8 | o6 d2 o5 b-4 f4 |
  o5 a-4 o6 c4 f4 a-4 | o6 g2 e-4 c4 | o6 c4 o5 a-4 e-4 f4 | o5 g4 b4 o6 d4 o5 b4 |

