# Alola: a steel drum doubling the tune, an ukulele on the bass's eighths, hand drums
track tunesteel steeldrum unless=lowhp double=lead vol=0.13 pan=-0.35 rev=0.3
track bassukulele ukulele double=bass beats=8 shift=24 vol=0.16 pan=0.35 rev=0.22
